: Predicate returning true iff `-a` does not overflow `i128` (`a != i128Min`).
: @dc l8589984709
pub v/b/canNeg i128Val/a
    test
        in structNew i128Val: u64:0 u64:0 ::
        out true.
        in structNew i128Val: u64:0 u64:9223372036854775808 ::
        out false.
    ne /a /i128Min.

: Checked StageL `neg` on `i128Val`, faulting on `i128Min` overflow.
